{
  "info": {
    "name": "SCRUM-104 Investor dashboard: income, expenses and returns card",
    "description": "Manual checks for GET /api/dashboards/investor/income-expenses-returns. See docs/investor-income-expenses-returns-card.md. Run the folders in order with the Collection Runner. Needs a running service (baseUrl), a Keycloak realm (keycloakUrl, clientIdKc), two users (A owns the data, B is another investor; both must have logged in to GeoZentra once) and two existing property IDs (propertyIdA, propertyIdB). Folder 1 creates a new portfolio for A and folder 6 deletes it with its holdings and records, so the collection can be repeated. Passwords are left empty: set them in your local environment and never commit them.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
